==English==
[[File:Venn A subset B.svg|150px|thumb|right|[[Euler diagram]] showing ''A'' is a proper subset of ''B'', &nbsp;''A''⊂''B'',&nbsp; and conversely ''B'' is a proper superset of ''A''.]]

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{lb|en|set theory}} a [[set]] that is a [[subset]] of the set, but not equal to it.
#: ''{2, 4, 5} is a '''proper subset''' of {1, 2, 3, 4, 5}, but {1, 2, 3, 4, 5} is not.''

